        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Seton Hall Pirates men's basketball team, New Jersey Devils, Big East Conference, National Hockey League\n- People: Kevin Willard\n- Places: Newark, New Jersey\n- Venues: Prudential Center\n\nFacts:\n- Prudential Center opened in 2007.\n- Prudential Center is the home venue of the New Jersey Devils of the National Hockey League.\n- Prudential Center is the home venue of the Seton Hall Pirates men's basketball team from Seton Hall University.\n- In the 2012–13 season, Kevin Willard was the head coach of the Seton Hall Pirates men's basketball team.\n- In the 2012–13 season, the Seton Hall Pirates men's basketball team played its home games at Prudential Center in Newark, New Jersey.\n- In the 2012–13 season, the Seton Hall Pirates men's basketball team were members of the Big East Conference.",
